@startuml get-manager-dashboard-coffee-chat-message
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/dashboard/coffee-chat/message
caption CRB-108 · 어드민 홈 대시보드 — 커피챗 신청 메시지 글자 수 평균과 분포 (앰플리튜드에서 이전). 읽기 전용, 기존 테이블만 집계. 개인정보 · 메시지 본문을 내려주지 않고 글자 수 집계만 내려줌 → access-log 없음

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "ManagerDashboardController" as Controller
participant "ManagerDashboardService" as Service
participant "AdminDashboardRepository" as Repository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/dashboard/coffee-chat/message?range=30d\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과 (admin · superadmin 모두 조회 가능)
alt range 검증 실패 (7d · 30d · 90d 중 하나, 생략하면 30d)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: getCoffeeChatMessage(query)
Controller -> Service: getCoffeeChatMessage(range)
Service -> Repository: messageLength(from = now - range)
Repository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT count(*) 메시지 수, avg(char_length(message)),\n  count(*) FILTER (WHERE len BETWEEN 0 AND 50), (51~100), (101~150), (151~)\nFROM coffee_chat_request WHERE created_at >= from AND message IS NOT NULL
PostgreSQL --> Repository: 집계 결과
Repository --> Service: 원시 집계값
note right of Service
  message가 NULL인 요청은 제외 (신청 메시지 최대 200자, MESSAGE_MAX_LENGTH)
  구간은 항상 4개 고정: 0~50 · 51~100 · 101~150 · 151~200 (포함 경계). 메시지가 없으면 평균 null, 구간은 0
end note
Service --> Controller: ManagerDashboardCoffeeChatMessageDto
Controller --> Client: 200 {\n  range, generated_at,\n  count, avg_length (null 가능),\n  histogram: [{ label: "0-50", min: 0, max: 50, count }, ... 4개]\n}

@enduml
